rir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Tu ressens de la fatigue sur ce footing ? C'est logique, on arrive en fin de cycle d'entraînement, ne lâche pas mais en même temps prends en compte cette fatigue ! Dors un peu plus, fais plus attention à ce que tu manges, utilise ton foam roller pour un bon massage des points de tension... Bref fais tout pour accélérer la récupération ! :)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":1,"weekDate":1788134400000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.894736842105263,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"Force_A42_600_3","description":"Séance \"mix\" qui va se dérouler en 2 blocs. Le bloc est constitué de 2x30\" à intensité maximale entrecoupées de 2'30 de récupération en footing très lent. Deuxième partie du bloc avec 20' à ton allure 42 km suivies de 5' de récupération. Enchaîne alors une deuxième fois ce bloc.","displayName":"Force + Allure 42km","coachAdvice":"Dernière séance mix, maintenant que tu l'as vécue 2 fois, tu dois te rendre compte qu'elle n'est pas si terrible que cela ! Il faut juste prendre l'habitude de courir à allure 42 km avec les jambes \"lourdes\" ! Mais tu t'en rappelleras lors de ta compétition, vers le 30/35ème km quand ça commencera à être vraiment dur... ce sera du connu pour toi !","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_15","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":2,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_2.5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":150,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"ENDU_FORCE_30.2","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Rapide","value":192,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"fast"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recuppassive_2.5.2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":150,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"A42_20","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Marathon","value":287,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"marathon"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":5,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_5","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":32